té."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.12","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. ADATCI propose l’addition suivante :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.13","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Elle peut également requérir l’avis des comités techniques constitués par le Conseil de la Société des Nations, lorsqu’il s’agit de questions qui rentrent par leur nature dans le ressort de leur compétence spéciale.”"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920","Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","weight":1.0,"end":59,"label":"Avis des comités techniques","lang":"full","start":32},{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.14","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cet amendement est rejeté, mais en s’en inspirant le PRÉSIDENT propose l’insertion après le mot „personnes” des mots „corps ou organes”."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.15","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"LORD PHILLIMORE veut ajouter le mot „bureaux”."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.16","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Sur la proposition de M. DE LAPRADELLE l’insertion de la formule „corps, bureaux, commissions ou organes” est adoptée."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.17","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 12."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.18","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté (avec des modifications rédactionnelles)."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.19","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Les débats sont dirigés par le Président, et à défaut de celui-ci par le Vice-Président; en cas d’empêchement par le plus ancien des juges présents."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.20","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"L’audience est publique, à moins qu’il n’en soit autrement décidé par la Cour à la demande motivée de l’une des parties."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.21","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Il est tenu de chaque audience un procès-verbal, signé par le Greffier et le Président."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.22","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Ce procès-verbal a seul caractère authentique."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.23","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour peut, même avant tout débat, demander aux agents de lui produire tout document et de lui fournir toutes explications. En cas de refus, elle en prend acte."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.24","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"A tout moment, la Cour peut confier une enquête ou une expertise à une ou plusieurs personnes (voir remarques) de son choix."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]},{"seg_id":"s0649.25","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":649,"printed":639,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Au cours des débats, les juges posent aux témoins, agents, experts, avocats et conseils, toutes questions qu’ils jugent utiles; les agents, avocats et conseils ont le droit de poser, par l’entremise du Président, toute question que la Cour juge utile."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.advice-of-the-technical-committees","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[649]}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":0},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":0},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meet